{"unit_id":"tag:0A07:proof","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为逆系统（inverse system），由对象（objects）组成，位于 <MATH_0002> 中。对 <MATH_0003> 归纳（induction），可以选取实际的复形（complexes）<MATH_0004>，由 <MATH_0005>-模（modules）组成，以及映射（maps），在复形（complexes）之间，<MATH_0006>，表示（representing）映射（maps）<MATH_0007>，位于 <MATH_0008> 中。换言之，存在对象（object）<MATH_0009>，位于 <MATH_0010> 中，其关联的逆系统（inverse system）是给定的那个。接下来，考虑交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0011>\n由拓扑斯态射（morphisms of topoi）组成。因此 <MATH_0012>。逐一核对定义，并使用引理 <REF_0001>，得到 <MATH_0013>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n当 <MATH_0014> 有足够多的点（enough points）时的另一证明。考虑定义性的特殊三角（distinguished triangle）\n<MATH_0015>\n在 <MATH_0016> 中。应用正合（exact）函子（functor）<MATH_0017>，得到特殊三角（distinguished triangle）\n<MATH_0018>\n在 <MATH_0019> 中。因此可见，只需证明 <MATH_0020> 与乘积（products）交换（commutes），在导出范畴（derived category）中（这些并非仅由乘积（products）给出，其项为复形（complexes），见《内射对象（Injectives）》引理 <REF_0002>）。然而，由于 <MATH_0021> 为右伴随（right adjoint），由引理 <REF_0003>，所以这形式地成立（见《范畴（Categories）》引理 <REF_0004>）。注意：不能直接应用《范畴（Categories）》引理 <REF_0005>，因为 <MATH_0022> 并非极限（limit），在 <MATH_0023> 中。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系统"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"induction","target_term":"归纳"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系统"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"morphisms of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"enough points","target_term":"足够多的点"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"特殊三角"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"特殊三角"},{"source_term":"products","target_term":"乘积"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"products","target_term":"乘积"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"Injectives","target_term":"内射对象"},{"source_term":"right adjoint","target_term":"右伴随"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系统","context":"导出对象或其复形代表的系统"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"导出范畴对象"},{"source_term":"induction","target_term":"归纳","context":"按系统指标选择代表"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"实际复形代表"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"结构环上的模"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"系统的过渡映射"},{"source_term":"representing","target_term":"表示","context":"实际映射代表导出映射"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"积位点上的导出对象"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"投影与直像的比较"},{"source_term":"morphisms of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射","context":"交换图中的态射"},{"source_term":"enough points","target_term":"足够多的点","context":"另一证明的条件"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"特殊三角","context":"定义同伦极限的特殊三角"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"导出直像函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"导出直像"},{"source_term":"products","target_term":"乘积","context":"复形及导出范畴乘积"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"导出直像与乘积交换"},{"source_term":"derived category","target_term":"导出范畴","context":"乘积所在的范畴"},{"source_term":"Injectives","target_term":"内射对象","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"right adjoint","target_term":"右伴随","context":"导出直像的伴随性质"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"limit","target_term":"极限","context":"导出极限与普通极限的区别"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0940:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面的引理适用于逆系统（inverse system），其项为拟（quasi）凝聚模（coherent modules），过渡映射（transition maps）为满射（surjective），位于代数空间（algebraic space）或代数叠（algebraic stack）上。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系统"},{"source_term":"quasi","target_term":"拟"},{"source_term":"coherent modules","target_term":"凝聚模"},{"source_term":"transition maps","target_term":"过渡映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数叠"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"inverse system","target_term":"逆系统","context":"拟凝聚模的逆系统"},{"source_term":"quasi","target_term":"拟","context":"本处为 quasi-coherent 的限定前缀，与后续 coherent modules 一起表示拟凝聚模"},{"source_term":"coherent modules","target_term":"凝聚模","context":"此处由 quasi 限定，完整意义为拟凝聚模"},{"source_term":"transition maps","target_term":"过渡映射","context":"系统的过渡映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"过渡映射性质"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"模所在的空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数叠","context":"模所在的叠"}],"notes":[]}
